French acoustic calibration attribution

French oral-vowel F1/F2 targets use measurements derived from:
Cnam-LMSSC Multilingual LibriSpeech French Phoneme
https://huggingface.co/datasets/Cnam-LMSSC/multilingual_librispeech_french_phoneme

The dataset is provided by the Laboratoire de Mécanique des Structures et des
Systèmes Couplés (Cnam-LMSSC) under the Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
International license:
https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/

The measurements were extracted from a single native-French speaker using
Montreal Forced Aligner boundaries and locally implemented LPC formant
analysis. The embedded targets conservatively interpolate between the prior
Text2Speech values and those measurements; the original recordings and
alignment files are not redistributed with this repository.
